    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Pigs is a screensaver that personalizes your computer and adds some fun.It provides a control panel to control the animation's behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although we doubt whether it can really protect the screen. Never mind, who doesn't want a few cute little pigs on the screen?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you activate this program, it will display a screensaver animation while your screen is idle, making your computer look more interesting. A group of little pigs will fly across your screen, and some items with wonderful effects will also appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still working on it. Planned work: coin counter, sound features, better multi-screen support.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Pigs is a screensaver that personalizes your computer and adds some fun.It provides a control panel to control the animation's behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although we doubt whether it can really protect the screen. Never mind, who doesn't want a few cute little pigs on the screen?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you activate this program, it will display a screensaver animation while your screen is idle, making your computer look more interesting. A group of little pigs will fly across your screen, and some items with wonderful effects will also appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still working on it. Planned work: coin counter, sound features, better multi-screen support.</p>",
